# Example custom variant for diplo: the standard board, but Turkey starts with
# a fleet in Smyrna instead of an army. A designer could test whether a second
# Turkish fleet shifts power-by-power results.
#
# Run it:  python -m diplo sim --map examples/maps/turkey_fleet_smyrna.map --years 3
#
# Format: the diplomacy package's .map format. "MAP standard.map" inherits the
# standard board (provinces, adjacencies, supply centers, drawing); the lines
# below reset ownership and then list each power's home centers and units.
MAP standard.map
UNPLAYED AUSTRIA, ENGLAND, FRANCE, GERMANY, ITALY, RUSSIA, TURKEY

UNOWNED                    BUD TRI VIE EDI LON LVP BRE MAR PAR BER KIE MUN NAP ROM VEN MOS SEV STP WAR ANK CON SMY
UNOWNED                    BEL BUL DEN GRE HOL NWY POR RUM SER SPA SWE TUN

AUSTRIA     (AUSTRIAN)     BUD TRI VIE
A BUD
A VIE
F TRI

ENGLAND     (ENGLISH)      EDI LON LVP
F EDI
F LON
A LVP

FRANCE      (FRENCH)       BRE MAR PAR
F BRE
A MAR
A PAR

GERMANY     (GERMAN)       BER KIE MUN
F KIE
A BER
A MUN

ITALY       (ITALIAN)      NAP ROM VEN
F NAP
A ROM
A VEN

RUSSIA      (RUSSIAN)      MOS SEV STP WAR
A WAR
A MOS
F SEV
F STP/SC

TURKEY      (TURKISH)      ANK CON SMY
F ANK
A CON
F SMY
